  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: StinkyMoniPostRevelationShi
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well, that could've gone better.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095212
    - rid: 1790118714061095213
    - rid: 1790118714061095227
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (<b>You</b> think I should've interrupted {mc} to lay out my plan a little
      earlier-?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095216
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (That way he wouldn't just up and bail on us when <b>we</b> could really
      use his help.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095217
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: ... <b>we</b>, Monika?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095218
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Yeah, <b>us</b>, who else-?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095219
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: The other girls and {mc}, Monika.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095220
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>All</i> of you could use his insight right now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Not <i>just</i> the two of <b>us</b>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095221
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah... well...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095222
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: You've been pretty nonchalant about the conditions and suffering of your
      fellow Dokis, Monika.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095224
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Dokis?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095223
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, that's just a term for all of you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Huh.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, you're all in this together, you should show a little more respect
      for them.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095225
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: You have as much power here as them, you have as much knowledge of this
      place as them- less knowledge than {mc}, even.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: So quit acting like you're this enlightened being who's above it all.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I, uh... didn't know you felt that way...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857611
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: It was at the back of my head for a while now, but, at this point, you've
      gone too far.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095226
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Look, just be better, got it?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (... yeah.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095228
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
